<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT-Australian Gold Index tests double bottom support.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Australian Gold Index tests double bottom support.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------Australian Gold Index-------------------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 1610 1650 1685 *RSI-14 30.82 *MA-10 1578.0</p>
<p>1540 - 1605  *Sup 1540 1500 1450 *MA-20 1577.2 *MA-40 1635.1</p>
<p>--------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - May 2---------------</p>
<p>*Index testing double bottom support</p>
<p>*Indicators seen oversold</p>
<p>*Traders likely to proceed with caution</p>
<p>*Gold index closed at 1,552.2 on Thursday</p>
<p>The Australian Gold shares index</p>
<p>has traded lower, beginning the month close to support at 1,540.</p>
</text>
